{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
<meta charset='utf-8'>
<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
<title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#fffdfb;--accent:#6a3be0;--muted:#616161;--card:#fff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
html,body{height:100%}
body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;line-height:1.45;margin:0;background-color:var(--bg);background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="480" height="480" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><defs><pattern id="p1" width="12" height="12" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><rect width="12" height="12" fill="%23fffdfb"/><path d="M0 8 L4 4 L8 8 L12 4" stroke="%236a3be0" stroke-opacity="0.06" fill="none" stroke-width="0.7"/></pattern></defs><rect width="100" height="100" fill="url(%23p1)"/></svg>');background-attachment:fixed}
.container{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:22px}
.header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#ff6a95);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:800;font-size:18px}
nav{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;padding:8px}
nav a.cta{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px}
.hero{display:block;margin-top:20px}
.card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(11,12,15,0.06)}
.columns{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px;align-items:start}
.section{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1),transform .6s cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
.section.revealed{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.section{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}}
input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #ececec;border-radius:9px;font-size:15px}
.button{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;border:none;cursor:pointer}
.meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
.small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.planner{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.plan-output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#fbf8ff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed #e9e3ff;font-family:Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px}
.footer{margin-top:24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}
@media (max-width:880px){.columns{grid-template-columns:1fr}
nav{flex-wrap:wrap}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class='container'>
<header class='header'>
<div class='brand'>
<div class='logo'>W</div>
<div>
<div style='font-weight:800'>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
<div class='small'>{{TAGLINE}}</div>
</div>
</div>
<nav aria-label='primary'>
<a href='index.html'>Home</a>
<a href='programs.html'>Cohorts</a>
<a href='services.html'>Ways to Work</a>
<a href='pricing.html'>Investment</a>
<a href='testimonials.html'>Stories</a>
<a href='about.html'>About</a>
<a class='cta' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
</nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class='hero card section' id='intro' aria-labelledby='intro-title'>
<h1 id='intro-title'>Connect, design, and walk away with a single-session script</h1>
<p class='meta'>Reach out to ask about cohort dates or build a short session here — a plain-text plan you can use right away.</p>
<div class='columns' style='margin-top:14px'>
<div>
<form id='contact-form' class='card' onsubmit='return false' aria-label='Contact form'>
<label class='small' for='name'>Your name</label>
<input id='name' name='name' placeholder='Your name' required>

<label class='small' for='email'>Email</label>
<input id='email' name='email' placeholder='{{EMAIL}}' required>

<label class='small' for='phone'>Phone</label>
<input id='phone' name='phone' placeholder='{{PHONE}}'>

<label class='small' for='message'>What would you like to change?</label>
<textarea id='message' name='message' rows='5' placeholder='A short description of your aim'></textarea>

<div style='display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px'>
<button id='send-btn' class='button' type='button'>Send message</button>
<a class='button' href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' style='background:#4a2f9b;text-decoration:none'>Book a chat</a>
</div>
<p class='meta' style='margin-top:10px'>Prefer direct? Email <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a>.</p>
</form>
</div>

<aside>
<div class='card section' id='planner-card' aria-labelledby='planner-title'>
<h3 id='planner-title'>Session Planner</h3>
<p class='small'>Build a concise session plan that emphasizes outcomes, weekly habits, and a step-by-step script.</p>
<div class='planner' role='application' aria-label='Session planner'>
<label class='small' for='goal'>Primary outcome</label>
<input id='goal' placeholder='e.g. calmer mornings, clearer work blocks, steadier sleep cues'>

<label class='small' for='weekly'>Hours you can commit weekly</label>
<select id='weekly' aria-label='weekly hours'><option value='1'>1 hour</option><option value='2'>2 hours</option><option value='4'>4 hours</option><option value='6'>6+ hours</option></select>

<label class='small' for='focus'>Focus areas (select multiple with Ctrl/Cmd)</label>
<select id='focus' multiple size='4' aria-label='focus areas'><option value='mornings'>Morning routine</option><option value='movement'>Movement</option><option value='sleep'>Sleep cues</option><option value='micro'>Micro-habits</option></select>

<label class='small' for='cohort'>Preferred format</label>
<select id='cohort'><option value='self'>Self-paced</option><option value='cohort'>Cohort (guided)</option><option value='one'>One-on-one</option></select>

<label class='small' for='start'>Ideal start date</label>
<input type='date' id='start'>

<button class='button' id='build-btn' type='button'>Build my session</button>

<div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px'>
<button class='button' id='copy-plan' type='button'>Copy plan</button>
<button id='download-plan' type='button' class='button' style='background:#6b6b6b'>Download .txt</button>
</div>

<div class='plan-output' id='plan-output' aria-live='polite'>Your plan will appear here.</div>
</div>
</div>
</aside>
</div>
</section>

<section class='card section' id='info' style='margin-top:18px'>
<h3>Quick answers</h3>
<p class='small'>Seats, start dates, and tailoring — we keep outcomes described as habits and frameworks you can practice.</p>
<ul>
<li>Typical cohort length: around 6 weeks with a weekly live session and small between-session practices.</li>
<li>Every attendee receives a plain-text session script to use immediately.</li>
<li>Late joiners: we provide a two-week catch-up guide.</li>
</ul>
</section>

<footer class='footer section' style='margin-top:18px'>
<p>Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a></p>
</footer>
</main>
</div>

<script>
(function(){
var prefersReduced = window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
function initReveal(){
 if(prefersReduced){
   document.querySelectorAll('.section').forEach(function(s){s.classList.add('revealed');});
   return;
 }
 var obs = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
   entries.forEach(function(ent){
     if(ent.isIntersecting){ent.target.classList.add('revealed'); obs.unobserve(ent.target);}
   });
 },{threshold:0.12});
 document.querySelectorAll('.section').forEach(function(s){obs.observe(s)});
}
if(document.readyState==='loading'){document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',initReveal);}else{initReveal();}

/* Session Planner */
var buildBtn = document.getElementById('build-btn');
var output = document.getElementById('plan-output');
var copyBtn = document.getElementById('copy-plan');
var dlBtn = document.getElementById('download-plan');

function mapWeekly(n){
  if(n==='1') return 'Micro: one short focused session + daily 5-minute practice.';
  if(n==='2') return 'Compact: two short sessions, one habit anchor, brief daily rituals.';
  if(n==='4') return 'Structured: weekly session plus 3 short practices across the week.';
  return 'Immersive: weekly live session with deeper between-session work.';
}

function buildPlainText(){
  var name = (document.getElementById('name').value||'Participant').trim();
  var goal = (document.getElementById('goal').value||'A clearer rhythm').trim();
  var weekly = document.getElementById('weekly').value;
  var focusSel = document.getElementById('focus');
  var focuses = Array.prototype.slice.call(focusSel.selectedOptions).map(function(o){return o.value;});
  if(focuses.length===0) focuses = ['Rhythm & small wins'];
  var cohort = document.getElementById('cohort').value;
  var start = document.getElementById('start').value || 'ASAP';
  var formatLabel = cohort==='cohort' ? 'Cohort (guided)' : (cohort==='self' ? 'Self-paced' : 'One-on-one');

  var lines = [];
  lines.push('{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — session script');
  lines.push('Participant: '+name);
  lines.push('Target outcome: '+goal);
  lines.push('Planned start: '+start);
  lines.push('Format: '+formatLabel);
  lines.push('Weekly capacity: '+weekly+' hour(s) — '+mapWeekly(weekly));
  lines.push('Focus areas: '+focuses.join(', '));
  lines.push('');
  lines.push('Session structure:');
  lines.push('1) Opening (5 min): Name intention and current baseline.');
  lines.push('2) Core practice (20-30 min): A guided sequence tied to focus areas — pick one focus this week.');
  lines.push('3) Implementation plan (5-10 min): Small, specific micro-habit anchored to an existing routine.');
  lines.push('4) Mini-accountability (2 min): One metric to check (time, repetitions, mood).');
  lines.push('');
  lines.push('Between-session routine:');
  lines.push('- Short daily reminder (1–5 min) tied to an existing cue.');
  lines.push('- Weekly short review to note one win and one tweak.');
  lines.push('');
  lines.push('Starter prompts to use in the session:');
  lines.push('- "What would success look like in one week?"');
  lines.push('- "Name one tiny repeatable action that connects to your routine."');
  lines.push('');
  lines.push('Plain next steps:');
  lines.push('- Set calendar for the first short practice.');
  lines.push('- Pick one cue for the micro-habit.');
  lines.push('- Share this plan with your accountability buddy or cohort.');

  return lines.join('\n');
}

buildBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
  output.textContent = buildPlainText();
});

copyBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
  var text = output.textContent || '';
  if(!text) return;
  if(navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText){
    navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){
      copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied!';
      setTimeout(function(){copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy plan';},1500);
    });
  } else {
    var ta = document.createElement('textarea'); ta.value = text; document.body.appendChild(ta); ta.select(); try{document.execCommand('copy'); copyBtn.textContent='Copied!'; setTimeout(function(){copyBtn.textContent='Copy plan';},1500);}catch(e){} document.body.removeChild(ta);
  }
});

dlBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
  var text = output.textContent || '';
  if(!text) return;
  var blob = new Blob([text],{type:'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});
  var url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
  var a = document.createElement('a'); a.href = url; a.download = 'session-plan.txt'; document.body.appendChild(a); a.click(); setTimeout(function(){URL.revokeObjectURL(url); document.body.removeChild(a);},500);
});

/* Simple send simulation */
var sendBtn = document.getElementById('send-btn');
sendBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
  var email = document.getElementById('email').value || '{{EMAIL}}';
  var subject = encodeURIComponent('New message from site');
  var body = encodeURIComponent('Name: '+(document.getElementById('name').value||'')+'\nPhone: '+(document.getElementById('phone').value||'')+'\n\nMessage:\n'+(document.getElementById('message').value||''));
  window.location.href = 'mailto:'+email+'?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;
});

})();
</script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Project chunk: contact page and notes for wellness_coach template (split_diagonal, playful_premium voice)

Files included:
- contact.html  — The contact page with an inlined SVG background (no external assets).

Key features implemented:
- Accessible, lightweight design with an inlined SVG pattern (data URI) used as page background to avoid external assets.
- Scroll-triggered reveal animation for sections using IntersectionObserver; respects prefers-reduced-motion (no motion when requested).
- Interactive "Session Planner" widget that:
  - Collects participant name, goal, weekly time, focus areas, preferred format, and start date.
  - Builds a concise plain-text session script summarizing outcome, weekly plan, session structure, between-session routine, starter prompts, and next steps.
  - Offers a Copy button (uses Clipboard API with fallback) and a Download .txt button.
- Contact form provides a simple mailto flow when sending (no backend assumed).

Placeholders left in the HTML (do NOT replace in this chunk):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Developer notes:
- The SVG pattern is inlined inside the CSS as a data URI to meet the constraints of no external images/assets. If you later split assets, move it to assets/img/pattern.svg and update the CSS URL.
- The planner deliberately outputs plain-text aimed at habits, routines, and frameworks (no medical claims) in compliance with the wellness coach rules.
- Navigation labels are intentionally non-standard (Cohorts, Ways to Work, Investment, Stories) but link to the canonical filenames used across the site.
- This chunk is self-contained; JavaScript is vanilla and avoids external libraries.

How to test locally:
1. Drop contact.html into the site root alongside the other pages.
2. Open contact.html in a modern browser.
3. Try the Session Planner: choose fields and click "Build my session", then Copy or Download.
4. Disable animations via OS settings to confirm reduced-motion behavior.

Notes about uniqueness and constraints:
- Copy and metaphors avoid repeated recent signature tokens as requested.
- No external fonts/CDNs used.
- No images are loaded; the decorative pattern is vector and inlined.

If you want the pattern extracted to a separate file in a subsequent chunk, request creating assets/img/pattern.svg and updating the CSS reference."}
BUNDLE_END
